{'symbol': 'MAR', 'date': '2022-03-01 09:00:00', 'title': 'MARRIOTT INTERNATIONAL DEBUTS ITS 8,000TH PROPERTY WITH THE NEWLY OPENED MARRIOTT BETHESDA DOWNTOWN AT MARRIOTT HQ', 'text': "BETHESDA, MD., MARCH 1, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0MARRIOTT INTERNATIONAL (NASDAQ: MAR) TODAY CELEBRATED THE OPENING OF ITS 8,000TH\xa0PROPERTY – MARRIOTT BETHESDA DOWNTOWN AT MARRIOTT HQ , A 12-STORY STYLISH RETREAT ADJACENT TO MARRIOTT INTERNATIONAL'S SOON-TO-OPEN NEW GLOBAL HEADQUARTERS IN BETHESDA, MARYLAND."}